  The article says the MP's name is Malayarasan and the district is Kallakurichi, but the draft refers to him only as 'நாடாளுமன்ற உறுப்பினர் மலையரசன்' which is consistent; however the caption/reel call the iron rod 'இரும்பு கம்பி' and state 'கல்வெட்டு மீண்டும் தெரியும் நிலைக்கு வந்தது' in slides_spec, which is an inference not stated in the article (the article only says the rod and concrete were removed)
  The slides_spec line 'கல்வெட்டு மீண்டும் தெரியும் நிலைக்கு வந்தது' (the plaque became visible again) is an invented outcome not present in the article
